  id: spell-minor-illusion
  displayName: Minor Illusion
  description: You create a sound or an image of an object within range that lasts for 1 minute. A creature can use its action to inspect the image and, on an Intelligence (Investigation) check against your spell save DC, discern it is an illusion. Pure utility -- no mechanical effect authored.
